<%# What an entry says: its bullet, its text, and its meta column. The Daily
    Log's rows and the Month and Future reading screens all render this, so the
    hand glyph, the struck treatment, and the meta rules have one definition.
    Callers that lead with something other than a signifier - a calendar day
    number, a future runway day - wrap it rather than restate it. %>
<% glyph_class = local_assigns[:glyph_class] %>
<span class="<%= class_names("entry__glyph", glyph_class) %>"><%= hand_glyph(entry.glyph) %></span>
<span class="entry__text <%= "entry__text--struck" if entry.state == "struck" %>"><%= entry.text %></span>
<%= render "entries/meta", entry: entry %>
